Data Dictionary v1.1

## Purpose

This document defines the standardized variables used in the real estate mispricing research pipeline.

Raw source fields are preserved separately from standardized and derived variables.

## Core Variables

| Source Field | Standard Variable       | Type        | Processing                       |
| ------------ | ----------------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------- |
| 거래금액(만원)     | `transaction_price_krw` | Integer     | Multiply source value by 10,000  |
| 전용면적(㎡)      | `exclusive_area_m2`     | Float       | Retain in square meters          |
| 계약년월 + 계약일   | `transaction_date`      | Date        | Combine into YYYY-MM-DD          |
| 건축년도         | `building_year`         | Integer     | Retain source value              |
| 층            | `floor`                 | Integer     | Retain source value              |
| 시군구          | `district_address_raw`  | String      | Preserve raw value               |
| 번지           | `lot_address_raw`       | String      | Preserve raw value               |
| 본번           | `lot_main_no`           | String      | Standardize as address component |
| 부번           | `lot_sub_no`            | String      | Standardize as address component |
| 단지명          | `complex_name_raw`      | String      | Preserve raw complex name        |
| 동            | `building_no_raw`       | String      | Preserve raw building/dong value |
| NO           | `source_row_id`         | Integer     | Source provenance only           |
| 해제사유발생일      | `cancellation_date`     | Date/String | Used for cancellation status     |

## Derived Variables

The following variables are derived during data processing:

* `complex_id_v1`
* `transaction_id`
* `transaction_status`
* `duplicate_candidate`
* `duplicate_status`

## Identity Hierarchy

The current data model distinguishes:

```text
Complex
   ↓
Building / Dong
   ↓
Exclusive Area / Unit Type
   ↓
Transaction
   ↓
Source Row
```

Definitions:

* `complex_id_v1`: provisional identifier for an apartment complex
* `building_no_raw`: building/dong identifier within a complex
* `exclusive_area_m2`: exclusive residential floor area
* `transaction_id`: identifier for an individual transaction
* `source_row_id`: provenance identifier from the source dataset

`source_row_id` should not be treated as a permanent transaction identifier across different data downloads or source versions.

## Data Layer Principle

The research pipeline separates:

```text
RAW_DATA
   ↓
CLEAN_DATA
   ↓
FEATURE_DATA
   ↓
MODEL_DATA
```

Raw source data should remain unchanged. Transformations and research assumptions should be documented in downstream layers.
